==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Astro is a light aqua [[Toon]] with his face resembling a waning crescent moon. The right side of his face is pitch-black with a white cross-shaped eye. He wears a cornflower blanket wrapped around his torso, obscuring his four arms to the point that they can be just seen as faint furrows in the blanket. However, his blanket is still short enough that it reveals his legs which are the same color as the crescent moon side of his face. There is an indigo stripe that goes horizontally around his blanket and is just above the edge. He uses glowing, neon cyan sparkles as hands, which are seen in some of his animations, with the right "hand" being star-shaped and the left being a larger, hollow star. Underneath his blanket, he wears medium black shorts that are barely visible due to the blanket covering them, but previous versions of him never had the shorts. He wears a dangling sleeping cap the same color as the stripe on his blanket, with a light blue trim and a light blue pom-pom at the tip. During [[Blackouts]], he emits a blue glow.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Astro's light aqua face and legs are now light gray and his right eye is pie-cut to the right. His blanket is gray with a dark gray stripe, and his sleeping cap is dark gray with a light gray trim and pom-pom. His sparkles and glow are also now white.
|-|Starry Night=
Starry Night Astro has his light blue face recolored pastel yellow. His eyebrow is curved downward, he has a squiggly frown, and has dark pink blush lines in between his eyes, which gives him an embarrassed expression. His blanket is a pinkish-purple color with a soft, light yellow blend on the upper half, and there are white dots scattered across. The blanket also has white fur lining on the hem, and his sparkle "hands" are pastel yellow. His sleeping cap is also pinkish-purple with a light yellow blend and white dots. The cap has white fur lining on the hem, and its pom-pom is light yellow and star-shaped, with a darker yellow center and two white dots on both sides. His shorts are white, and his legs are pastel yellow with white socks that have dark pink toes and heels. His glow is the same color of his sparkles.
|-|Star-Time=
[[Star-Time Cosmetic Pack|Star-Time]] Astro's face appears closer to an actual moon, being light bright gray with three darker spots on his forehead and between his eyes, two on the lower corner of his face, and a cheek-like one on the right of his regular eye. His blanket is dark bluish-gray with a lighter stripe and cyan and yellow tassels on the edge. The smaller star-shaped sparkle is colored a lighter cyan, while the larger one is yellow. His sleeping cap is dark bluish-gray like his cape and also has a yellow trim and pom-pom, and has a white clip decorated by a cyan star that is placed on the left of the trim. The cap is significantly longer, so long that it almost touches the ground, and the lower half of the cap is curved so that it doesn't. His legs are bright gray and have three darker spots on the shins, while he wears a yellow slipper on the left foot and a cyan on the right. He leaves behind a transparent, azure-yellow gradient trail when walking, and it consists of stars, moons, dots, and smaller versions of the shapes. He also produces white twinkles around his head.
|-|Bedtime Bear=
[[w:c:carebears:Bedtime Bear|Bedtime Bear]] Astro has a slightly darker, star-shaped cheek mark and has his eyelid, which is coated with shiny, teal eyeshadow, curved downward. He bears a warm smile and his blanket is sky blue with a light blend on the upper half, and it also has a a white, fluffy collar. Furthermore, the blanket has a pom-pom in the center of the back, a dark blue heart toward the right of it, and a white spot in the front with a light blue, sleeping crescent moon that has a yellow star next to it. His sleeping cap is also sky blue with a white fluff trim, along with a white cloud pattern on the upper half and a yellow, bear head-shape on the tip of the cap. His star "hands" are colored sky blue. He wears white slippers, each decorated with a yellow star. When moving, he leaves behind a translucent, rainbow gradient trail of hearts, rainbows, clovers, rainclouds, and various sparkles. He also produces light blue twinkles around his head.
