Scarlet Night Astro has a vermillion red face and a tired expression, with his eyebrow curved downward and situated directly above his right eye. Its upper eyelid is lowered and has crimson colored eyeshadow with two lighter, shiny lines, along with red makeup underneath that fades towards the right where three darker red spots are situated. A fang sticks out from the left of his mouth, and his left eye is "X" shaped. His blanket gradates from dark gray to muted red, and has jagged edges along with five jagged ends near the back of his neck, forming a collar. His sleeping cap has the same color scheme as his blanket, but with the pom-pom being a vermillion droplet shape that represents blood. His star-shaped hands are colored red, but without the glow. He wears a five-pointed tiara, with the middle and end points being larger than the two in between, and is colored crimson like his eyelids with similar shines. He now wears crimson pants with lighter stripes on the legs, followed by purely black footwear. The glow he emits is recolored to red.
